1 NOTE (from Nuland, p.A14/17)  Between Greifswald and Stralsund in German Pommeranina lies the country village of Miltzow.  Several hundred years ago a lineage came from this small town to Norway.  Here they were called the Miltzow-clan
2 CONC .  They established themselves and lived especially in the west country.     One of the first we know about of this family in this Norway was Klaus Miltzow.  His father was "court bailiff" in Treptow in Pommerania. Klaus moved to 
2 CONC Bergen.  He served for a while at the German office.  He became a citizen in 1580. In 1586 he began serving as the king's "head man".  This position he held until one year before he died in 1595.   He was married to Ann Falkoner, 
2 CONC daughter of mayor Falkoner in Nidaros (Trondheim).  Klaus Miltozw also was a merchant and a rich man.
1 NOTE (from Nuland, p.A14/17)  Between Greifswald and Stralsund in German Pommeranina lies the country village of Miltzow.  Several hundred years ago a lineage came from this small town to Norway.  Here they were called the Miltzow-clan
2 CONC .  They established themselves and lived especially in the west country.     One of the first we know about of this family in this Norway was Klaus Miltzow.  His father was "court bailiff" in Treptow in Pommerania. Klaus moved to 
2 CONC Bergen.  He served for a while at the German office.  He became a citizen in 1580. In 1586 he began serving as the king's "head man".  This position he held until one year before he died in 1595.   He was married to Ann Falkoner, 
2 CONC daughter of mayor Falkoner in Nidaros (Trondheim).  Klaus Miltozw also was a merchant and a rich man.
1 NOTE Millom Greifswald og Stralsund i Pommern ligg landsbyen Miltzow. For nokre hundrad aar sidan kom det fraa denne vesle byen ei ætt til Noreg, som her i landet vart kalla Miltzow-ætti. Det var serleg paa Vestlandet ætti livde og spr
2 CONC edde seg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Klaus var ein av det fyrste ein veit um av den ætti som kom her til lands. Far hans var 'domfoged' i Treptow i Pommern. Klaus vart buande i Bjørgvin. Han tente fyrst ei tid ved det tyske kontoret. So tok han borgarskap i 1580. I 1
2 CONC 586 vart han byfogd. dette emættet hadde han til aaret fyrr han døydde i 1595. Han var gift med Anna Falkoner, dotter til borgarmeister Falkoner i Nidaros. Klaus Miltzow var og kjøpmann, og han var ein rik mann.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her er et utdrag for Norske Magasiner side 543:
2 CONT Claus Milzow, fød af ærlige egteforældre, fader Henrich Miltzow, raad, Kammerer og domfoged udi alten Treptow auf der Tollensche, som havde sit arve- og odel- og landgods liggende tre fjerdingsvej derfra paa og udi de landsbyer Gr
2 CONC aptzow, Kessin og Bollentin, hvilket hans fyrstelige naade hertug Ernst Ludvig til Settin og Pommern etc. siden fik i possession. Hans moder var Anna Hannemans; kommen hid til Bergen, er han efter en anseelig kjøbmandshandel, saav
2 CONC el først ved Kontoret nogen tid lang, som siden udi byen af hannem forsynligen ført, forordnet og beskikket den 12 Marts anno 1586 at være kgl. majts. byfogd udi Bergen, hvilket bestilling han i aatte samfulle aars tid forestod og
2 CONC  imilertid for mere end 3900 rdlr. gjort rede og regnskab, som kvittanserne, af de velbyrdige lensherrer Niels Blid til Ravnholt og Peder Thott til Boltinggaard hannem givet udvise. Han akkomoderede ogsaa udi sine huse anno 1591 p
2 CONC aa høje øvrigheds begjering grotfyrsten av Moskau hans gesanter. Men anno 1594 resignerede han for sin svagheds skyld sin bestilling, og den 8 Juli udi næstefter følgende aar 1595 døde af denne verden.
