2 CONT http://home.online.no/~er-joha/db/fam/fam07530.htm
2 CONT http://www.nose.dk/Norge/falch.html#14
1 NOTE RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT Bailiff in Helgeland; Lived in Nord-Her”;
