2 CONT Talgje kyrkje.jpg Talgøy (Talgje) is a parish in Finnøy clerical district. Records begin in 1673.  Microfilms at the Family History Library cover the years:  See FamilySearch Catalog for full details and microfilm numbers.  ◾Chris
