2 NOTE Jens Pedersen Schjelderup's seal used by his wife Susanna on parchment charter transferring property called Gassegrunn. They had owned the property since 1567, and she transferred it to Domincus Friis after Jens death. Parchment i
3 CONC s in University of Bergen archives, photo courtesy of them. Archive record notes it was unusual that a wife would retain possession of an important person's seal, as they are often abused and usually destroyed to avoid that.
1 NOTE Susanna fikk 10 barn, fire døtre og seks sønner.
1 NOTE     * RESIDENCE: 10 barn (4 døtre, 6 sønner) (12 ?)
2 CONT     * BIRTH: ABT 1525, (Leinersdatter) Danmark (usikre foreldre)
2 CONT     * DEATH: 1582, (ca. 1584 ?) Bergen 
1 NOTE Susanna Leonhardsdatter (Lennertsdatter) Datter af Leonhard (Lennert)
2 CONT (Mitens?). (Sted)datter til professor Peter Capeteyn i København. Er man
2 CONT sikker på at hun hed Leonhardsdatter/Lennertsdatter ?
1 NOTE    Datter af Leonhard (Lennert) (Mitens?).
2 CONT      (Sted)datter til professor Peter Capeteyn i København.
2 CONT      Er man sikker på at hun hed Leonhardsdatter/Lennertsdatter ?
2 CONT      Hennes far sies at være en Leonhard Mitens bror av Christopher Mitens (d. 1566) fra 
2 CONT Flanders og prest til St. Morten kirke i Bergen. Christopher Mitens (d. 1566) skal være far til en 
2 CONT Gabriel Mitens (1560-1620) der bosatte sig på Færøerne.
