2 CONT [Nanna.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mentz Christophersen 4 Darre (Christopher 3 Bjørnssøn, Bjørn 2 Rolfssøn, Rolf 1 Olufssøn); born 30 Sep 1598 at Trondheim; married Maren Pedersdatter Schjelderup, daughter of Peder Jenssøn Schjelderup and Anna Nilsdatter Holch, 163
2 CONC 2;5 died 4 Dec 1657 at Trondheim at age 59.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was Stiftsprost og sogneprest til Trondhjems domkirke.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mentz Christophersen4 Darre and Maren Pedersdatter Schjelderup were as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT + 13 i. Peder Mentzsøn5 Darre, born 27 Jan 1633 at Trondheim; married Magdalene Stephensdatter Soop.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 14 ii. Anna Mentzdatter, born 25 Apr 1634 at Trondheim; married Lars Pederson Krabbe.
2 CONT
2 CONT 15 iii. Oluf Mentzsøn; born 6 Jun 1635; died 9 Apr 1639 at age 3.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 16 iv. Oluf Mentzsøn, born 8 Feb 1636 at Trondheim; married Helle Andersdatter; married Riborg Hansdatter Meyer.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 17 v. Christopher Mentzsøn, born 12 Nov 1638; married Elline Hansdatter Røst.
2 CONT
2 CONT 18 vi. Hermann Mentzsøn; born 12 Feb 1640 at Trondheim; married Gjertrud Andersdatter Riiber, daughter of Anders Nilsen Riiber and Mille Melchiorsdatter Falch; died 12 May 1670 at Hamarøy, Nordland, at age 30.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was Sogneprest i Hamarøy.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 19 vii. Johan Mentzsøn, born 21 Jul 1641; married Gjertru Hansdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 20 viii. Gidsken Mentzdatter, born 27 Jul 1643 at Trondheim; married Mogens Hanssøn Blix; married Niels Pedersen Riberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 21 ix. Peder Mentzsøn, born 28 Sep 1646; married Kirsten Andersdatter Blich Opdal; married Mille Michelsdatter Falch.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 22 x. Sophie Mentzdatter, born 19 Dec 1649 at Trondheim; married Peder Henrichson Ascanius.
2 CONT
