3 CONT Note that most of the information on Jacob Nielsen Graae and his 3 wives and 5 children is based on this source: Innsetboka II, pp 198-200, and 116-117. Some contributors (and curators?) have distorted the information several time
3 CONC s, I'm afraid. If things need to be changed in the future, please give the sources for the information they are based on.
2 NOTE Jacob Nielsen Graae was born in Slesvig, then Danish, and at an early age joined his uncle ?Benoni, at the Kvikne copper? mine management. 
2 NOTE Tomb stone outside the main entrance of the Innset church, showing the importance of Jacob Nielsen Graae for the community. He contributed to the church financially, and donated an important chandelier, adding to the interior deco
3 CONC rations. 
