2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders was born before 1679 in Assens on the Island of Fyn in Denmark. The 
2 CONT churchbook, of which I have seen the microfilm does not go back that far.  The birth date is from a death age likely. Anders had a brother Peder  baptised October 24, 1680 and a brother Jorgen baptised Ap 10, 1683. Their  father J
2 CONC ens was buried Sept 20 1699 and their mother Nov 11, 1683. She  appears merely as Jens Kierumgaard's hustru so she is nameless.
