1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The traditions says that I came from Denmark and stranded/settled at Lista in 1688 and got married there. But new information says that I was present there already in before 1680. This assumes that I arrived Norway
2 CONC /Lista about 1675.
2 CONT
2 CONT Some have the opinion that I am the son of Jonas Borhaug which is supposed to have arrived from Denmark in the period 1600 - 1650.But this is hardly the case. 
2 CONT
2 CONT There is no doubt that I am the anchestor of the great Lund family in Fahrsund.
2 CONT
2 CONT I settled and married at Borhaug. Unfornately my first wife Guldbjørg Borrehof died early and I had to remarry. My second wife was Birthe Jocumsdatter at Hervold. 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT STAMFAR TIL DEN OMFATTENDE LUND-SLAKTEN I NORGE.
2 CONT
2 CONT Begravet 17 Januar 1700: Eilert Jonsen Borrehof 55 Aar. (Ministrialok Vanse/Vanse 1691-1715 , 1700 side 28)
2 CONT
2 CONT Listaboka II 882.
2 CONT
2 CONT Se også Farsund By's historie - spesielt sidene 125 flg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Se "En by og en bank" av Johannes Seland 1967. Side 30 -- (Første gang utgitt i 1947) (link:  https://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/49165341926320480c44ca7af790d56d?lang=no#5)
2 CONT
2 CONT Se også "Farsund-Lundene" ved Oberst Gabriel Lund 1950. Side 54--- (link:https://www.nb.no/nbsok/nb/b5f994fa764d32d394703a69e7eb44b8?lang=no#0)
2 CONT
