1 NAME Isach Georg /Rosenvinge/
2 GIVN Isach Georg
2 SURN Rosenvinge
2 _MARNM Rosenvinge
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 16 MAR 1767
2 ADDR
3 CITY Frosta
